{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33367","headline":"及第後作 · 袁皓","name":"及第後作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金榜高悬姓字真，分明折得一枝春。\n蓬瀛乍接神仙侣，江海回思耕钓人。\n九万抟扶排羽翼，十年辛苦涉风尘。\n昇平时节逢公道，不觉龙门是嶮津。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"袁皓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33367.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33367","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}